659	     * Counts the existing owners that share both {@code firstName} and {@code lastName} with the
660	     * given new {@code owner}, compared case-insensitively (with incidental whitespace collapsed).
661	     * The owner being created is not itself persisted yet, so the result is the number of namesakes
662	     * that already existed before this create.
