892	    /**
893	     * Derives the deterministic {@code householdId} from the normalized {@code lastName} and
894	     * {@code postcode}: the first 12 upper-case hex characters of SHA-256 over
895	     * {@code lastName + '|' + postcode}, so all owners in the same household share the same
